@DecisionPlannerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5189
@meetingId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Create a meeting
POST {{DecisionPlannerApi_HostAddress}}/api/meetings
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"title": "Projection Meeting: Architecture review",
	"description": "Review the next Meeting use cases.",
	"startsAt": "2026-09-24T10:00:00Z",
	"endsAt": "2026-09-24T11:00:00Z"
}

### Add a participant
# Replace @meetingId with the id returned by the create-meeting request.
POST {{DecisionPlannerApi_HostAddress}}/api/meetings/{{meetingId}}/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Alex Morgan",
	"email": "alex.morgan@example.com"
}
